@@@!atrep-hom
@=litogramma=>at-html

@@/ Semantic representation: litogramma's typed sims survive as
@@/ genos-classed generic containers wherever HTML has no
@@/ element, so a stylesheet can recover the distinctions. The
@@/ nesting flattens (extract) and goes one way: rebuilding
@@/ litogramma structure from flat headings awaits group rules.

@@/ Front matter.
@:: = #
@:: =_ , .subtitle
@:: =: , .author
@:: =; , .editor
@:: =" _ .abstract
@-- =#=

@@/ Structure: nested sections dissolve into flat headings.
@<# == #
@<# === ##
@<# # ###
@<# ## ####
@<# ### #####
@<# #### ######
@:: #_ !
@:: . , .ordinal
@-- **

@@/ Inline. Emphasis and annotation map implicitly.
@:: * !
@:: */ !
@:: $ , .math
@<< $$

@@/ Lists. Unordered forms map implicitly.
@:: .- .
@<< ::;
@<# :: !
@<< ;

@@/ Drama. Verse and verse-dialogue ride at-html's verse sim.
@:: :~ ~ .dialogue
@<# := ##
@<# :# ###
@<# : !
@:: :! !
@<# :!! !
@:: :( /
@:: :[ _ .stage-direction
@:: :- , .dialogue-line
@:: :_ , .dialogue-tag
@:: :. , .pause

@@/ Notes dissolve into running text; their deixes go with them.
@<< ^
@<< ^^
@<< ^^^
@<< ^!
@:: | _ .aside

@@/ Quotations. The blockquote attribution drops at this hop
@@/ (at-html's blockquote is bare; lossy rename).
@:: " >
@:: "" , .quotation
@<< "/
@:: -/ , .date

@@/ Figures and tables.
@<# < !
@@/ at-html has no table family yet; a table and its rows, cells
@@/ and spans drop (recorded loss, as into at-docbook).
@-- +
@-- +-
@-- +=
@-- +:
@-- +>
@-- +_

@@/ Containers.
@<# _ !
@<# _= !
@<# _- !
@<# _: !
@<# _/ !

@@/ Apparatus: references have no anchor machinery in at-html;
@@/ the visible-URL link passes through.
@-- >
@-- >>
@-- >>>
@-- >>>>
@-- >[
@:: >: , .standards-ref
@:: >< ><
@<< %
@-- %%

@@/ The unseen pack (at-aphanes) has no counterpart here: its
@@/ monosims drop (recorded loss; the printed text is untouched).
@-- ?:
@-- ?.
@-- ?&
@-- ?>
@-- ?-
@-- ?%
@-- ?~

@@/ The parsing pack (at-epimerismos) has no counterpart here: its
@@/ monosims drop; the token and sentence diaphanes pass through.
@-- !.
@-- !=
@-- !/
@-- !%
@-- !&
@-- !>
@-- !-
